# Logs
logs/
*.log
logs/**/*.log

# Copilot Hooks — auditoria local (nunca commitar logs brutos nem estado transitório)
.github/hooks/logs/
.github/hooks/state/session-context.json
.github/hooks/state/session-context-*.json
.github/hooks/state/session-briefing.md
